    "_doc": "ErAV NTR Part 3 - I household, the family dog (draft I lottery event 2; content-gated). The entry branch borrows the second son (son_b, who sends her to the kennel) and the dog (membertype_erav_client_household_dog, generator creature_animal_dog). The dog's ExecuteAPOnSingleChara sits inside a branch option with a skip fallback: whether the COM succeeds or fails (creature content off), both options jump to after_dog and the scene ends normally. Every ending (error path included) runs ResolveEvent and releases son_b + dog. The female housekeeper is narration-only.",

